    "body": "DOM Standard defines isTrusted as follows:\n\n> event . isTrusted\n> Returns true if event was dispatched by the user agent, and false otherwise.\n\nI am not sure how we could interpret \"event was dispatched by the user agent\" strictly.\nI tend to agree @smaug:  A click event triggered by `element.click()` is dispatched by users, instead of UA. I confirmed that element.click() doesn't dispatch trusted events in Blink.\n",
    "created_at": "2016-10-05T08:03:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-18T06:13:42Z",
