    "body": "That is not a normative description of `isTrusted` though. That's just sort of what it does. We don't really have a normative description anywhere. It's currently left to those dispatching events in various specifications.\n\nI thought maybe the ECMAScript stack being empty would be it, but `postMessage()` results in untrusted events, so that's not it either.\n",
